      en: ["Warrap State is home to an estimated population of over 3 million head of cattle.", "The Kuajok plant was built to help diversify the local economy away from oil revenues.", "The facility features modern slaughtering lines and cold storage for beef and goat meat.", "Local processing significantly cuts down the cost of transporting meat to the capital, Juba.", "The plant promotes the introduction of livestock tagging and health monitoring systems.", "Future upgrades include dedicated solar power installations to run the refrigeration units."],
